## Suggested fix

Some options, roughly in order of how much they actually solve:

- Keep the SQL out of the form entirely: send the statement as the raw body (or as a URL `query=` entry when small) and put only `param_*` into the multipart body. That removes failure mode 1 and restores parity with the non-multipart path. `insert_formatted_with`-style URL-statement + body-data split is the same idea.
